  your Facebook advertising budget. If you need approval for your advertisin
 g budget\, please make sure the decision-maker is on the call with you or h
 as pre-approved your investment plan.\n* Have images and/or videos ready to
  use in your ads.\n* Be at your computer\, with Ads Manager open during the
  call.\n* Optional: Download the Bluejeans plug-in\, if you would like to s
 hare your screen during the call.\n\nWe have reviewed your Facebook ads acc
 ount\, and look forward to sharing recommendations that may help you get mo
