UID:6tim6dr3cpi68bb271h32b9k61gm2bb1cko3gb9jckr3ccpm6pj32ohpc8@google.com
CREATED:20191114T224600Z
DESCRIPTION:Event: https://facebook.com/events/770878980023344/\n\nFriday\,
  December 20th: PA Line “Chrismukkah Show” w/ The Grumpy Monkey Company and
  special guests.\n\n-Doors: 8:00pm\, show: 9:00pm \n-Tickets: $7 ADV/$10 DO
 S - $2 off if you bring a gift for kids in need (items for Toys for Tots) \
 n-Ages: 18+\n\nAbout PA Line: \nInspired by grassroots\, infused with soul\
 , born from the indie scene. The sound of PA Line proves that in the curren
 t musical world of repetition and catchy leads\, music can still hit you in
  the heart. By combining dedication and raw talent\, Trever Stribing (Lead 
 vocal/Guitar/Percussion)\, Lucas Honig (Vocal/Bass) & Ryan Howze (Vocal/Spe
 cial Percussion/Instrumentation) have made a unique brand of alternative-fo
 lk music.\n\nHailing from Buffalo\, NY\, PA Line brings a unique\, harmony-
 packed\, funky\, Folk-Rock\, world sound\, that has been described as Mumfo
 rd & Sons meets Rusted Root. Touring extensively through the U.S.\, Canada\
 , & the U.K.\, PA Line is gathering quite the name for themselves.\n\nPlayi
 ng large events such as The NYC Marathon\, Watkins Glen International Racew
 ay & opening up for acts such as Rusted Root\, Iron & Wine\, Floodwood\, & 
 Rumpke Mountain Boys\, they are hitting the road in 2018 to support their f
 ull-length release\, Peace Always. You never know what will happen at a PA 
 Line show. Get your dancing shoes on\, it surely will be a night not to for
 get. \n\nAbout The Grumpy Monkey Company: TGMC was founded in the summer of
  2018. We hail from various places including NC\, TN\, CO and our very own 
 Buffalo NY! We play a strong mix of ccountry\, folk and rock ND roll. \n\nF
 or more information or to listen to our original recorded music\, please vi
 sit thegrumpymonkeycompany.com
LAST-MODIFIED:20191114T224600Z
LOCATION:Buffalo Iron Works
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:PA Line's Chrismukkah Show at Iron Works - DEC 20
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
