UID:ccs34dr2corjeb9pcos6cb9kckr38b9ocdh32bb3c4q3ipj3cco3aor2c8@google.com
CREATED:20220317T033059Z
DESCRIPTION:Event: fb://event/252100163782281\n\nPA Line coming to The HUB 
 Stratford all the way from Buffalo\, NY as part of their Southern Ontario t
 our!! We are SO excited to welcome an intimate experience to our guests wit
 h an amazing evening with Trevor Stribing (lead vocal/guitar/percussion) an
 d Lucas Honig  (Vocals/Bass) as a duo on Friday\, March 18th kicking off at
  5pm! Inspired by grassroots\, infused with soul and born from the indie sc
 ene\, they will leave you in absolute awe. Their high energy creations have
  received recognition in 28 states\, 3 countries\, and 2 continents.\nThey 
 currently have 3 albums out\, "Liar" and "Breathe"\, and the full length LP
  "Peace Always"\, released in 2018. Having been playing music together for 
 almost a decade\, Their parallel drive and catchy rhythms are something you
 'll never forget. Book your spot online at www.thehubstratford.com or give 
 us a call at 519.508.2337. 
