DESCRIPTION:Hey Trever!\n\nHere are the details for Summerfest:\n\nStrange 
 Summerfest 7\nDate: August 9th\, 2025\nLocation: Hilltop Inn & Grove\nAddre
 ss: 11389 Genesee St.\, Alden\, NY 14004\nTicket Price: $20 pre-sale\, $30 
 day of\nSet Time: 7pm - 8:30pm\nPay: $800 + percentage of the door after $3
 000 (still haven't locked in the exact percentage number for each band but 
 around 1/6)\nSound Provided: Hilltop\nSound Engineer: Billy Bork\nLights Pr
 ovided: Brandon Wilfrom\nLoad In: At least an hour prior to your set\nGuest
 s:  Each band member gets one free guest\nPromo: Do at minimum a weekly soc
 ial media post in the month leading up to the event\, we'll have running ad
 s on socials as well as hopefully radio and TV promo. We also spotlight the
  bands in the weeks leading up to the festival. \nPosters: We'll give you s
 ome to bring to shows and festivals!\nPhysical tickets: You can sell physic
 al tickets if you want your fans to avoid service fees! This money will go 
 directly to your guarantee unless you bring the unsold tickets back\nAnnoun
 ce Date: 5/2 we'll be announcing the full lineup \nLineup: Strange Standard
 \, St. Vith\, PA Line\, Kids in the Basement\, Prairie Pavement\, Sally Sch
 aefer & Tyler Bagwell\, Philip Stephen\, Sara Elizabeth\, Hyzerflight \nSpo
 nsors: We are working on getting 2-3 sponsors. If successful we will lower 
 the threshold to make a percentage (i.e. if we get $600 in sponsorship mone
 y you make 1/6th after $2400). If you have anyone you can recommend let us 
 know! We're in touch with some local recording studios and we're going to r
 each out to lawyers and realtors. \nFestival Shirts: Band members can get f
 estival shirts for a discount\, just $10 (to cover the cost of us making th
 em)\n\nLet me know if I missed anything!\n\nThanks!\n\nJack\nStrange Standa
 rd\n(716)247-9857
LAST-MODIFIED:20250801T125637Z
LOCATION:The Hilltop Inn & Grove\, 11389 Genesee St\, Alden\, NY 14004\, US
