 e New York State Craft Brewers Festival\, Buffalo at Canalside Saturday\, J
 une 25th from 2-6pm!\n\nExperience fresh craft beer from over 50 breweries 
 from every corner of the state and meet the people who make the beer you lo
 ve. The brewers and owners will pour at this festival and are excited to sh
 are their beer and knowledge with you! Enjoy local food trucks\, artisan ve
 ndors and a farm-to-table tent.\n\nTICKETS & INFO: www.thinkNYdrinkNY.com/b
 uffalo\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~
