DESCRIPTION:Hello! \nI run Whirlybird Music & Arts Festival and have partne
 red with Lifted - JTNY and Wicked Warren's Jamestown to bring great bands i
 nto town throughout the festival off-season. Wicked Warren's had mentioned 
 that yall were interested in getting into their venue. What dates do you ha
 ve available October 10 - Nov 29? Would like to set you up with a $1\,200 g
 uarantee + an occupancy bonus and hospitality for the band. We can also pro
 vide sound and an engineer if you prefer (Josh Almquist\, MegaSound). Let m
 e know what you think. Would love to work with you and bring you into Whirl
 ybird next summer!\n- Miki\n\n\nMiki Girts\nFestival Director\nWhirlybird M
 usic & Arts Festival\nJamestown\, NY\nwww.whirlybirdfest.com\n\n-::~:~::~:~
