DESCRIPTION:Event: fb://event/438376391539036\n\nThe street will be filled 
 with family friendly fun from 12pm-4pm transitioning to a street party with
  LIVE Music from PA LINE and local craft beer and mead from 4pm-10pm.   Par
 ticipating breweries include 12 Gates\, Britesmith\, Old First Ward\, Eli F
 ish\, Rusty Nickel and West Shore Brewing. We’ll have LIVE music in the aft
 ernoon\, a DJ\, turkey legs\, ice cream\, cotton candy\, street performers\
 , axe throwing\, tarot card readings\, a water balloon stocks toss\, food t
 rucks and much\, much more!  We’ll keep adding details and updating this pa
 ge leading up to the event!\n\n#mead #beer #drinklocal #craftbeer #drinkloc
 albeer #drinklocalcraftbeer #lancasterny #buffalony #buffalo #craftmead #su
 pportlocal #localhoney #wnyhoney #craftmead #patioseason #livemusic #dogfri
 endly #renaissancefaire 
