DESCRIPTION:$1200\nFood/drinks/camper to sleep\nApparently it's a huge part
 y with a few hundred people\nSound provided \nHeadliners\n\nThis is for the
  people of the Sun\nIt’s coming back around again…\n\nThat’s right Memorial
  Music Friends\, \nthat time has come… \nComin’ in hot. \nThe time to gathe
 r\, to celebrate good times\, to laugh and laugh and fall apart.\nThe time 
 to share what’s cooking in your kitchen\, please pass it around the Porch\n
 Hey Mrs Maudry\, when you gonna put those dishes down? \nTime to share the 
 clean and set\, \nit’s a MMFamily affair ❤️\n‘Cause they all ask for you\, 
 \neven inquired about you\nLaissez les bon temps rouler\nGet up. Get on dow
 n to\n\nMemorial Music Feast 2023\n41 Main St\, Bloomfield\nMemorial Day we
 ekend\, May 26-29\nSat and Sun to play in the Band(s). We got some good goo
 d stuff for ya! 🎶\nMMFriday to set. MMonday to parade\, to honor\, and to 
 drag your weary bones on home\n\nBYOB and dish to pass\nCampers and tents w
 elcome\, Rooms at ‘the In’\nCarwheels on a gravel road (not ruts\, John…)\n
 MMFire (as in camp\, not works)\, please bring chairs and drinks and vessel
 s for drinking\n\nMMFree (as in Foleys) and Refreshed for Spring and Summer
 … here comes Sunshine\nTime to give thanks and praises\nContributions for m
 usicians and provisions gratefully appreciated\nPaypal memorialmusicfeast@g
 mail.com \nVenmo @christophermevans\nCash or check or gin 😉\n\nParty peopl
 e! 💃🏻🕺🏼1 week to go 🛎️🦵🏽🦵🏽!!\n\nThe Line up:\nSaturday \nPA Line 
 🎻 🪘 \nRad 🪕\n(and maybe a special ’tweener)\n\nSunday\nThe Half Steps ✌️
 \nDave and Bob 🎶🎤\n\nMonday\n🇺🇸\n☕️\nChris\n 585 766 9940\n\n-::~:~::~:
