UID:chi3cc1m6opm6bb6cli6ab9k71h34b9o61i3ab9n6osjgc1o6hh66d9h6k@google.com
CREATED:20240917T181357Z
DESCRIPTION:Event: fb://event/2537007539824623\n\nPA LINE - inspired by gra
 ssroots\, infused with soul\, and born from the indie scene\, performs at D
 rumroll Stage + Sushi Pub on Friday\, November 15\, 2024!\n\nEVENT DETAILS:
 \nPA LINE\nFriday\, November 15\, 2024\nDrumroll Stage + Sushi Pub\, 86 Cou
 rt Street\, Geneseo\, NY 14454\nDoors: 7:00 p.m. │ Show: 8:00 p.m.\nTickets
 : $10 at the door \nAges 21+\n\nABOUT: \n\nPA LINE\npalineofficial.com\n\nT
 he sound of PA LINE strives to prove that in the current musical world of r
 epetition and catchy leads\, music can still hit you in the heart. By combi
 ning dedication and raw talent\, Trever Stribing (lead vocal/guitar/percuss
 ion)\, Lucas Honig (Vocal/Bass)\, Griffin Brady (Vocal/Special Percussion) 
 and Pete Caroccio (Electric Violin/Electric Mandolin/Vocals) have made a un
 ique brand of alternative-folk music\, described as True-Grit Americana\n\n
 Hailing from Buffalo\, NY\, PA Line brings a unique\, harmony-packed\, funk
 y\, Folk-Rock sound that has been described as Mumford & Sons meets Rusted 
 Root. Touring extensively in 28 states\, 4 countries\, in 2 continents. Thr
 ough the U.S.\, Canada\, & the U.K.\, PA LINE is gathering quite the name f
 or themselves\n\nThe name PA Line comes from a simple catchline of the lead
  singer’s late father: “Peace Always.” This mantra is carried in their atti
 tude towards the industry and their fans\n\nAfter a few incredible opportun
 ities playing large events such as the NYC Marathon\, The Great Blue Heron 
 Music Festival\, The Big "G" Jam and opening up for acts such as Rusted Roo
 t\, Iron & Wine\, Floodwood\, & Rumpke Mountain Boys\, extensive tours on t
 he road support their full-length release "Peace Always\," and performed Ma
 in Stage at Fingerlakes Grassroots Festival\, Cobblestone Live!\, and Borde
 rland Music Festival.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20240917T181357Z
LOCATION:Drumroll Stage + Sushi Pub
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Drumroll Presents: PA LINE
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
