DESCRIPTION:Budget:  $800-$900 (approx)\nSet length:  2.5 hours (2:15 PM to
  4:45 PM)\nTime:  Event will run from 2-5 PM\nFood/beverage:  2 Food Trucks
   / 15 LOCAL breweries serving samples of 30 different beers (Ticket price 
 includes 20 (3 oz) beer samples - Food not included)\nTips:  OK\nUsing our 
 sound?:  YES\nLighting:  N/A\nParking:  VIP parking for band (easy in/out)\
 nGuest list:  250-350 TBD\nSchedule for evening:  This is an indoor/outdoor
  event.  Large tent outside.  Small tent outside for band.  Band will be se
 tup in elevated garden area behind Martin House (map coming soon).\nSite wi
 ll be open for setup after 12:00 PM\nBeers starts flowing at 2PM\nBand star
 ts around 2:15 PM\n2-3 sets with breaks as needed\nMusic until 4:45 PM\nBee
 r stops flowing at 5 PM\n\nTicket price:  Members $60 / Non-Members $70\nMa
 rketing strategy:  This is a fundraiser for the Darwin Martin House.  Estab
 lished Festival/Event since 2013.  Last year = 450 attendance.  Normally he
 ld 1st Friday in July\, delayed due to Covid.  Normally 20-25 breweries.  N
 ow 15 breweries.  Expecting to return to normal next year.  Event is market
 ed using numerous print media and (digital) social media platforms used by 
 the Martin House.  Marketing will include sponsor names/logos.  PA Line art
 work is welcome.\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~
